# For the images built from the repo root (health-tracker's api/ and web/, wealth-tracker/frontend, trackerai/api,
# trackerai/web, tabstealth's api/ and web/): only what they COPY goes in. wealth-tracker's API image still builds from
# wealth-tracker/ with its own .dockerignore.
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!packages/
!health-tracker/web/
!health-tracker/api/
!health-tracker/tools/
!health-tracker/scripts/seed_demo.py
!wealth-tracker/frontend/
!trackerai/api/requirements.txt
!trackerai/api/app/
!trackerai/web/
!tabstealth/web/
!tabstealth/api/
**/node_modules/
**/.next/
health-tracker/web/out/
**/__pycache__/
**/.venv/
tabstealth/api/data/
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.env*
**/.DS_Store
